{"id":"n88914-1-13","stage":3,"title":"힘껏 · 尽力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88914-1-13-1","ko":"문이 잠겼는지 잘 안 열리는데요?","zh":"门好像锁上了，怎么打不开呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"문이","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠겼는지","meaning":"被锁","explanation":"잠기다：被锁；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"잠기다","audio":"/audio/8d315ca40d132df6b2e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73643","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열리는데요?","meaning":"开","explanation":"열리다：开；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74352","senseId":"1","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e2c7d5c49b61f532","term":"문","zh":"门","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3","entryId":"43832","definition":"为了能让人出入或能拿放东西而制作的可以开关的设施。","pronunciation":["문"]},{"id":"8d315ca40d132df6","term":"잠기다","zh":"被锁","audio":"/audio/8d315ca40d132df6b2e7.mp3","entryId":"73643","definition":"门等被用锁或栓条扣住使别人无法打开。","pronunciation":["잠기다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"b6ba3a226396d7d0","term":"열리다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3","entryId":"74352","definition":"关着或闭着的东西被打通或掀开。","pronunciation":["열리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/57852b3a41f4e4916731.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88914-1-13-2","ko":"열려 있으니 한번 힘껏 밀어 보세요.","zh":"门是开着的，试试用力推一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열려","meaning":"开","explanation":"열리다：开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"열리다","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74352","senseId":"1","lemma":"열리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘껏","meaning":"尽力","explanation":"힘껏：尽力","readings":[{"term":"힘껏","audio":"/audio/76d98b6d5696c26d5c8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88914","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘껏","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀어","meaning":"推","explanation":"밀다：推；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"밀다","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74177","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b6ba3a226396d7d0","term":"열리다","zh":"开","audio":"/audio/b6ba3a226396d7d01d21.mp3","entryId":"74352","definition":"关着或闭着的东西被打通或掀开。","pronunciation":["열리다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"76d98b6d5696c26d","term":"힘껏","zh":"尽力","audio":"/audio/76d98b6d5696c26d5c8a.mp3","entryId":"88914","definition":"用尽全力地；或全力以赴地。","pronunciation":["힘껃"]},{"id":"2e251676952afc35","term":"밀다","zh":"推","audio":"/audio/2e251676952afc35931d.mp3","entryId":"74177","definition":"向想要的方向用力使物体移动。","pronunciation":["밀ː다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7817d6fdf0eab9ffffb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88914","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["门好像锁上了，怎么打不开呢？","门是开着的，试试用力推一下吧。","你好像瘦了一点吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["门好像锁上了，怎么打不开呢？","门是开着的，试试用力推一下吧。","你好像瘦了一点吧？"],"answer":1}]}
